  "content": "<oer-draft note=\"Brief from the DART 413 course plan. Revise it, then Publish to show it to readers.\">\n<p>For each required reading, a 200–300-word response that connects one idea in the text to something you made or saw in the shop that week.</p>\n<h2>What to hand in</h2>\n<ul><li>Responses posted before the class that discusses the reading</li></ul>\n<h2>What you'll practise</h2>\n<ul><li>Read theory against practice</li></ul>\n<p>Time: recurring</p>\n</oer-draft>\n"
